  "title": "Small House",
  "colorTheme": "light",
  "heading": "A critical collaboration with R Architecture for a residence that transforms constraint into opportunity, celebrating industrial character within a compact urban form.",
  "content": "<p>A uniquely considered design, shaped by a highly constrained inner-city site. The project vision centred on delivering a functional and light-filled residence within a compact 6-metre-wide footprint. Drawing inspiration from Brunswick’s industrial character, Haven’s role was to bring this vision to life with precision, navigating spatial limitations and complex geometries. The detailed construction led to a home that feels both expansive and distinctly grounded in its context.</p>",
