    {
      "type": "section-intro",
      "heading": "In collaboration",
      "subheading": "Philosophy",
      "content": "<p>This project embraces the challenge of a compact inner-city block, turning spatial constraints into opportunities for innovation and light-filled living. The materials, surfaces and details were considered to reflect the industrial character of Brunswick while maintaining clean, contemporary lines. By weaving together recycled brick, polished concrete, curved steel and carefully crafted joinery, the design celebrates both functionality and personality, creating a home that feels expansive and luminous, distinctively grounded in its context.</p>\n",
