    {
      "type": "list-carousel",
      "heading": "Project Highlights",
      "description": "Small House transforms its narrow block into a light-filled, three-bedroom home that feels spacious and functional. The Industrial-inspired materials are balanced with clean white plaster surfaces and birch ply joinery to create a modern warehouse aesthetic. Cathedral and vaulted ceilings, along with strategically placed skylights and a fully glazed rear façade, draw natural light deep into the home while maintaining privacy from neighbouring properties. Thoughtful details, such as the offset spine-back staircase with integrated tile inserts, mesh balustrading, and a rain garden for sustainable roof runoff, enhance both the functionality and personality of the residence, ensuring every element contributes to a cohesive, expressive design.",
